<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <title>Low Stock Alert - Eshop</title>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-color: #f9fafb;
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        color: #111827;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 8px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
      }

      .header {
        background-color: #dc2626;
        padding: 20px;
        text-align: center;
        color: #ffffff;
      }

      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 24px;
      }

      .body {
        padding: 30px;
      }

      .body h2 {
        margin-top: 0;
        font-size: 20px;
        color: #111827;
      }

      .alert-box {
        background-color: #fef2f2;
        border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        margin-top: 20px;
      }

      .product-info {
        background-color: #f3f4f6;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        margin-top: 15px;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .product-info p {
        margin: 8px 0;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      .stock-warning {
        color: #dc2626;
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .button {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #2563eb;
        color: #ffffff !important;
        padding: 12px 20px;
        margin-top: 20px;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 5px;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      .footer {
        padding: 20px;
        font-size: 12px;
        text-align: center;
        color: #6b7280;
        background-color: #f9fafb;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>⚠️ Low Stock Alert</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <h2>Hi <%= sellerName %>,</h2>
        <p>
          One of your products is running low on stock and needs your attention!
        </p>

        <div class="alert-box">
          <p style="margin: 0; color: #dc2626; font-weight: 600">
            📦 Stock Level Below Threshold
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="product-info">
          <p><strong>Product:</strong> <%= productTitle %></p>
          <p><strong>Current Stock:</strong> <span class="stock-warning"><%= currentStock %> units</span></p>
          <p><strong>Your Threshold:</strong> <%= threshold %> units</p>
          <p><strong>Category:</strong> <%= category %></p>
        </div>

        <p style="margin-top: 20px; color: #374151">
          <strong>Recommended Action:</strong> Restock this product soon to avoid running out of inventory and missing potential sales.
        </p>

        <a href="<%= productUrl %>" class="button">View Product Details</a>

        <p style="margin-top: 25px; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280">
          💡 Tip: You can adjust your low stock threshold in your seller settings to receive alerts at different inventory levels.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Eshop. All rights reserved.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
